				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "BHKZzFTpQjKgJe6lPvV4TA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## GT's reference implementation\n\n{{gtClass:name=GtPharoMethodExpanderStyler}} (a {{gtClass:name=GtCoderAstStyler}}) walks the AST in {{gtMethod:name=GtPharoMethodExpanderStyler>>visitMessage:}}, creates {{gtClass:name=GtPharoMethodExpanderAttribute}} instances at each message send, gives each a unique ID, and attaches them via `text attribute:from:to:`. Each attribute lazily builds its expanded element via a stencil block (see {{gtMethod:name=GtPharoMethodExpanderAttribute>>initialize}}). We mirror this exactly."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "{{gtClass:name=ElixirFunctionExpanderStyler}} extends {{gtClass:name=GtCoderAstStyler}}. {{gtMethod:name=ElixirFunctionExpanderStyler>>style:ast:}} queries BEAM for call sites and attaches expander attributes inline."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "{{gtClass:name=ElixirFunctionExpanderAttribute}} extends {{gtClass:name=BrGlamorousTriangleExpanderTextAttribute}}. {{gtMethod:name=ElixirFunctionExpanderAttribute>>buildExpandedElement}} fetches function source from BEAM and renders it with a header showing `Module > function/arity`."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "elementSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"code" : "BrGlamorousTriangleExpanderTextAttribute gtSubclassesFor: GtPhlowView new",
							"elementHeight" : 100,
							"codeHeight" : 50,
							"codeVisible" : true
						}
					]
				},
