					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Our chain\n\nMirrors GT's reference: a styler walks the AST and attaches expander attributes; each attribute knows how to fetch and render its expanded element."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
