				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Registration\n\nAdd to the coder via `addOns addStyler: ElixirFunctionExpanderStyler new` in {{gtMethod:name=GtElixirCoderModel>>initializeAddOns:}}. The composite styler runs it automatically on text changes — no manual call needed."
			},
