				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "4X+pIufdQPigSJcswMh0VA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## BEAM-side\n\n`GtBridge.Analysis.call_sites(source, contextModule)` parses the source AST, walks remote calls, resolves aliases (using context module's preamble if not in source), and filters out unresolvable, unsourced, or non-existent functions. Returns `[%{target_module, function, arity, line, column}]`.\n\nThe styler caches sites by source hash to avoid round-tripping the BEAM on every restyle (cursor moves, etc.). Cleared whenever source actually changes."
			}
		]
